 season: \n🍀Thursdays: 5:30-7:30pm\n🍀Weekends: 10am-1pm\n* 1st & 3rd weeke
 nds: Sundays\n* All others: Saturdays\n\nNo prior experience is needed to v
 olunteer! We garden communally and each garden shift is led by a gardening 
