CREATED:20260923T214501Z
DESCRIPTION:Learn how to grow your own oyster mushrooms using a simple buck
 et method! Please bring your own container: a bucket or food-safe container
  with a lid ie. large yogurt container or soup-to-go container works great!
  <br><br>Date: Sunday\, October 25<br>Time: 12–2 PM  <br><br><b>RSVP here:<
 /b><br><b> </b><a href="https://docs.google.com/forms/d/e/1FAIpQLSeTZUmw21B
 TPpmG4xqAmvtc9qDiYBmHVjjYyAfqphUsYrN-UQ/viewform?usp=header">https://docs.g
 oogle.com/forms/d/e/1FAIpQLSeTZUmw21BTPpmG4xqAmvtc9qDiYBmHVjjYyAfqphUsYrN-U
 Q/viewform?usp=header</a><br><br><b>NOTE</b>: We have only 10 spots for thi
 s workshop. If you have RSVP'd and cannot make it\, please email<b> compost
 .mscg@gmail.com</b> ASAP so we can give the spot to someone else.
LAST-MODIFIED:20261017T153826Z
LOCATION:237 Maple St\, Brooklyn\, NY 11225\, USA
SEQUENCE:0
STATUS:CONFIRMED
SUMMARY:Grow Your Own Oyster Mushrooms At Home! 
TRANSP:OPAQUE
