  in collaboration with <a href="https://teaartsculture.org" target="_blank"
 >Tea Arts and Culture</a> and Garden Minders. <br><br>Participants will hel
 p make a delicious oat milk chai and learn about the warming spices used to
  personalize our beverage. They'll also engage in flower bundle dyeing givi
 ng them the opportunity to take home a beautiful piece they make themselves
 .
